    {
      "id": "claim_2247e6192eb64d42a853bf948064687e",
      "statement": "The HTTP MCP server binds to options.host, falling back to the QMD_HOST environment variable and then to localhost; the CLI defaults the port to 8181 and passes --host only when given.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cli/qmd.ts#L5098-L5104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b5d118f8aa300b9e9c94686f58cde3b4f0f7b273283b112d20d12c6a68429594:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/server.ts#L1148-L1148",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:df266057e86db142fad6509fc46e19ee2ecc840f0ef6e5783a6a08b7ca236adb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1c614e0bcb714345b7bc71cd74d10c69",
      "statement": "Every HTTP request, including the REST routes /query, /search, and /metadata, is screened by the Origin/Host guard before any routing takes place, so REST endpoints are covered by the same DNS-rebinding defense as /mcp.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/server.ts#L1163-L1183",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cb1c3b66917ac71370fad67713803c9fab96d95d5d9cf15e8c9dfaa2875fe0d7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_15712175937a4c24af27ea246d5461ea",
      "statement": "A rejected request receives HTTP 403 with a JSON-RPC-style body whose error code is -32003 and whose message is 'Forbidden: ' followed by the reason, and the rejection is logged unless quiet.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/server.ts#L1170-L1179",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:69579de1a305b4e95049c92b8e4f78d67b84abb3fe0af4176bccbb30a4c35af9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a3c456462eea49048bb8eae69bdf62aa",
      "statement": "The Origin check is skipped when the origin allowlist contains '*', which disables all guard checks, and it is also skipped when the request carries no Origin header; non-browser clients that omit Origin are therefore unaffected.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/origin-guard.ts#L101-L102",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fc6fa37066b65f862201944f0678d987e6a8348e66fafcce53ee91d3d68777c1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/origin-guard.ts#L139-L142",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:90d92e01bc872aa1479a4481b26b8713a2057fe0cb2d34e2091507afa4ab8c2b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b7868e56df5e4097be5bfa74597ad538",
      "statement": "A present Origin is accepted when its hostname is a loopback name (localhost, *.localhost, ::1, 127.0.0.0/8, IPv4-mapped loopback) or when its normalized origin is in the allowlist; otherwise the request is rejected with 'Origin not allowed'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/mcp/origin-guard.ts#L143-L149",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ee4238fe19d56bd66716a6f3fa699be3552409268103b96428bcad74fc0701be:"
        },
        {
