      "id": "claim_01d18571da6d4662b3aec08c61d516ff",
      "statement": "At startup the server logs a plain-text warning, with no warning code, when QMD_ALLOWED_ORIGINS is '*' (DNS-rebinding protection is off) and when it binds without QMD_ALLOWED_HOSTS and Host validation is off; the warnings are suppressed in quiet mode.",
